OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of heavy
OL,6,Frain in the early morning. This will
OL,7,Fturn showery from mid-morning before
OL,8,Fbecoming dry and then brighter during
OL,9,Fthe afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will be mostly
OL,12,Fdry with only a chance of an odd
OL,13,Fshower. The night will then stay dry
OL,14,Fwith clear periods.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FDry with bright or sunny
OL,17,Fspells in the morning becoming cloudy
OL,18,Ffrom the afternoon with rain spreading
OL,19,Fto the Western Isles in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
