OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FOutbreaks of locally heavy rain turn
OL,7,Fshowery later Monday. Scattered
OL,8,Fshowers clear Tuesday evening. Showery
OL,9,Frain, some heavy or thundery spreads
OL,10,Feast Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
